  annotation = {TLDR: Robin3D is introduced, a powerful 3DLLM trained on large-scale instruction-following data generated by the novel data engine, Robust Instruction Generation (RIG) engine, which consistently outperforms previous methods across five widely-used 3D multimodal learning benchmarks, without the need for task-specific fine-tuning.},
