  annotation = {TLDR: This work designs an RLVR-based post-training strategy with verifiable rewards for region alignment, trajectory consistency, and output formatting, thereby strengthening reasoning robustness and execution accuracy and develops VLA-CoT-13K, a high-quality dataset.},
