  annotation = {TLDR: This work improves existing noise sampling techniques for training rectified flow models by biasing them towards perceptually relevant scales and presents a novel transformer-based architecture for text-to-image generation that uses separate weights for the two modalities and enables a bidirectional flow of information between image and text tokens.},
