  annotation = {TLDR: The proposed IP-Adapter is an effective and lightweight adapter to achieve image prompt capability for the pretrained text-to-image diffusion models and has the benefit of the decoupled cross-attention strategy, the image prompt can also work well with the text prompt to achieve multimodal image generation.},
