  annotation = {TLDR: This paper proposes a novel communicative agent framework named role-playing, using inception prompting to guide chat agents toward task completion while maintaining consistency with human intentions, and showcases how role-playing can be used to generate conversational data for studying the behaviors and capabilities of chat agents.},
