  keywords = {Computer Science - Artificial Intelligence,Computer Science - Multiagent Systems},
  annotation = {TLDR: MetaGPT is introduced, an innovative framework that incorporates efficient human workflows as a meta programming approach into LLM-based multi-agent collaboration and leverages the assembly line paradigm to assign diverse roles to various agents, thereby establishing a framework that can effectively and cohesively deconstruct complex multi- agent collaborative problems.},
