  annotation = {TLDR: DC-VideoGen is introduced, a post-training acceleration framework for efficient video generation that combines a Deep Compression Video Autoencoder with a novel chunk-causal temporal design that achieves 32x/64x spatial and 4x temporal compression while preserving reconstruction quality and generalization to longer videos.},
