  annotation = {TLDR: A new neuro-symbolic approach, GraSP-VLA, a framework that uses a Continuous Scene Graph representation to generate a symbolic representation of human demonstrations that serves as an orchestrator for low-level VLA policies, scaling up the number of actions that can be reproduced in a row.},
